%I A400620 #4 Oct 06 2026 20:55:08
%S A400620 2,3,7,11,23,31,59,107,111
%N A400620 Record values of 4*x - p over primes p, where x is the smallest denominator occurring in any solution of 4/p = 1/x + 1/y + 1/z in positive integers.
%C A400620 The primes at which these records occur are in A400619. See there for the method and search limits.
%C A400620 Searched for all primes below 4*10^11.
%e A400620 a(3) = 7 because 4/73 = 1/20 + 1/219 + 1/4380 with 20 the least possible denominator, 4*20 - 73 = 7, and every prime below 73 has a smaller value.
%Y A400620 Cf. A075245, A257839, A292624, A392470, A400619.
%K A400620 nonn,more,new
%O A400620 1,1
